# Itzquinth, Firstborn of Gishath (2/3 haste): "When Itzquinth enters, you may pay {2}. When you do, target Dinosaur you control deals
# damage equal to its power to another target creature." Turn 3: Bot1 casts Itzquinth beside an Ornithopter (0/2) and a Giant Cindermaw
# (4/3 Dinosaur, cast on turn 1) and pays {2} as the trigger resolves; the reflexive trigger then asks for its targets, one at a time.
# The first must be a Dinosaur Bot1 controls (the Ornithopter is refused); the second must be another creature than the first (the
# Cindermaw is refused again). Bot1 picks the Cindermaw and the Ornithopter: the Cindermaw deals 4 to it and it dies, the Cindermaw
# is not dealt damage back (one-sided).

